-CEO OS is a focus and self-control app designed to help you protect your time, reduce distractions, and follow through on your goals.
-
-Use CEO OS to:
-- block distracting apps during focus sessions
-- block selected websites on Android in supported browsers
-- start Focus Mode and CEO Mode for stricter protection
-- apply daily limits to selected apps and supported websites
-- schedule pauses and time-based restrictions
-- keep your account, tasks, habits, notes, and focus setup in one place
-
-On Android, CEO OS uses on-device protection flows to help enforce your selected restrictions. Accessibility is used to detect when a selected distracting app or supported website is opened, Usage Access is used for daily-limit enforcement, and display-over-other-apps permission is used to show the blocking shield.
-
-CEO OS is built for self-control and digital wellbeing. It does not present itself as a disability accessibility tool, and it does not claim universal website blocking across all Android browsers or web views.
-
-Premium features may be offered through subscriptions where available.
+CEO OS is a personal control center for focus, discipline, and everyday execution. It brings the settings that matter most into one place so you can shape your environment more intentionally: focus sessions, app blocking, website limits, daily limits, planned pauses, tasks, habits, and notes.
+
+Instead of juggling separate tools, you manage your concentration from one adaptable workspace:
+- start Focus Mode to protect a work session
+- activate CEO Mode for stricter protection
+- block distracting apps
+- limit selected websites on Android in supported browsers
+- apply daily limits to selected apps and supported websites
+- schedule pauses and time-based restrictions
+- keep routines, tasks, habits, and notes in the same control center
+
+On Android, CEO OS uses on-device protection flows to apply the restrictions you choose. Accessibility is used to detect when a selected distracting app or supported website is opened, Usage Access is used for daily-limit enforcement, and display-over-other-apps permission is used to show the blocking shield.
+
+CEO OS is designed for self-control and digital wellbeing. It does not present itself as a disability accessibility tool, and it does not claim universal website blocking across all Android browsers or web views.
+
+Premium features may be offered through subscriptions where available.
